summary:
Hawaii, 1985. Experience the Soviet-American War through the eyes of three men:
Lt. Nikolay Avilov, a skilled and violent soldier known by his comrades and the propaganda machine as “The Hunter” – ruthless, brutal, and the herald of victory;
Lt. Semyon Rusakov, head of his special operations unit and an unmatched marksman, serving with his comrade and friend Sgt. Eduard Belikov;
And Pvt. Iosif Pelevin, a God-fearing young rifleman who looks up to The Hunter as a hero – but he must decide where his faith lies if he is to come back from the jungle victorious.
